    Lower log level for filter parsing errors (#6254)
    
    Opencast is noisy when users pass in invalid filters. This lowers the
    log level to debug.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    1. Pass invalid filter to External API (e.g. leave out the `:`)
    2. Observe what log level is used
    
